WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:04.210
My name is Bailey Arlinghaus and I'm from
Huston Texas.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:09.250
In 2012 I graduated from Clements High School
in Sugar Land Texas.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.830
Currently I am a Spanish and Political Economy
major at Hillsdale College in Michigan, and

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.089
this spring I have the privilege of interning
at the Heritage Foundation.

00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:22.169
The Washington Hillsdale Internship Program,
we

00:00:22.169 --> 00:00:27.009
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere
between ten to twenty students a semester

00:00:27.009 --> 00:00:28.039
out to DC.

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:31.490
They take two or three classes and they intern
on the hill, at the Heritage

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.820
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:39.450
When we find somebody coming out of college
who has some practical real world experience,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.120
especially experience that applies to what
we do, it really sets them apart.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.520
Washington is one of those places that kids
can learn a lot and gain a lot just from being

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.880
hear a few moths.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:55.200
And in that since, coming here and having
that interning experience I guarantee will

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.610
be life changing.

